WEBVTT

00:01:27.857 --> 00:01:30.147
sleeping either too much or too little,

00:01:30.147 --> 00:01:32.256
restlessness or slowness,

00:01:32.256 --> 00:01:35.562
or persistent thoughts of suicide.

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:38.397
Worldwide, about one 
to three percent of adults

00:01:38.397 --> 00:01:43.597
experience the broad range of symptoms
that indicate bipolar disorder.

00:01:43.597 --> 00:01:46.967
Most of those people are functional,
contributing members of society,

00:01:46.967 --> 00:01:49.527
and their lives, choices, 
and relationships

00:01:49.527 --> 00:01:52.097
aren't defined by the disorder,

00:01:52.097 --> 00:01:55.697
but still, for many, the consequences
are serious.

00:01:55.697 --> 00:01:59.426
The illness can undermine educational
and professional performance,

00:01:59.426 --> 00:02:00.578
relationships,